Canonical conformance fixtures
==============================

Third-party files copied unmodified from the upstream projects below, used by
spec/claricle/conformance/canonical_fixtures_spec.rb. PNG is covered by PngSuite
in spec/claricle/png_spec.rb and is not repeated here. Each file keeps the
license of its source, which permits redistribution with this notice.

svg/  IETF svgcheck test inputs (svgcheck/Tests/)
  Source:  https://github.com/ietf-tools/svgcheck  at 52f2845f1379ead67444d61660c6ad79774985ec
  License: BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (C) 2017, 2022 IETF Trust
  Files:   svgcheck-good.svg, svgcheck-DrawBerry-sample-2.svg,
           svgcheck-viewBox-none.svg, svgcheck-malformed.svg
  Note:    svgcheck checks the RFC 7996 SVG profile; its expected verdicts
           (svgcheck/Results/) were used as the reference for these four.

svg/  W3C SVG 1.1 Second Edition Test Suite (accepted tests)
  Release: https://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/Test/20110816/
  Archive: https://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/Test/20110816/archives/W3C_SVG_11_TestSuite.tar.gz
           SHA-256 b5f46cca1ad79b670f9179770b2366c57efd5c671d084144090feab4b7ff1030
  License: W3C Document License,
           https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license-2023/
           Copyright 2008-2009 World Wide Web Consortium (MIT, ERCIM,
           Keio University). The embedded copyright notices are retained.
  Files:   shapes-circle-01-t.svg
           https://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/Test/20110816/svg/shapes-circle-01-t.svg
           struct-svg-01-f.svg
           https://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/Test/20110816/svg/struct-svg-01-f.svg
           extend-namespace-01-f.svg
           https://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/Test/20110816/svg/extend-namespace-01-f.svg
  Note:    These accepted test IDs were extracted without modification. They
           form a software-development subset, not an authoritative W3C Test
           Suite or a claim of complete SVG 1.1 conformance.

