  Source:  https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-corpus at bb75f4f0073d9350dfd058c0162a367e6fadf25e
  License: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
           (c) veraPDF Consortium and contributors. Unmodified.
  Files:   verapdf-6-8-2-2-t01-pass-a.pdf  (PDF_A-1a/6.8.2.2, "pass" file)
           verapdf-6-2-3-2-t01-pass-a.pdf  (PDF_A-1b/6.2.3.2, "pass" file)

pdf/  qpdf test suite (malformed files)
  Source:  https://github.com/qpdf/qpdf at 4eba95899886e851cc41d76886483b347612f2a8
           (qtest/qpdf/bad-xref.pdf, qtest/qpdf/bad10.pdf)
  License: Apache-2.0, Copyright Jay Berkenbilt and Manfred Holger
  Files:   qpdf-bad-xref.pdf, qpdf-bad10.pdf

emf/  Apache POI test data
  Source:  https://github.com/apache/poi at ae62bb5116b9aee19ebd5834e3a82066132c9f7f
           (test-data/document/vector_image.emf, test-data/slideshow/wrench.emf,
            test-data/spreadsheet/63327.emf, test-data/spreadsheet/61294.emf,
            test-data/slideshow/crash-7b60e9fe792eaaf1bba8be90c2b62f057cfff142.emf)
  License: Apache-2.0, Copyright The Apache Software Foundation
  Files:   poi-vector_image.emf, poi-wrench.emf, poi-63327.emf (valid);
           poi-61294.emf (record size 4294902055 at byte 2384),
           poi-crash-7b60e9fe.emf (header declares 40276 bytes, file is 21258)

Not used: the EMF fixtures shipped with the emf gem (claricle/emf spec/fixtures)
come from kakwa/libemf2svg, GPL-2.0, which this BSD-2 gem does not redistribute.
